{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"What is judged here","level":2,"anchor":"What-is-judged-here","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Everything a repair cannot reach. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","type":"reference"},{"text":" rejects what could never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be repaired and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","type":"reference"},{"text":" repairs what it can, but neither","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"judges: normalization is total, so a defect it could not repair arrives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"here intact.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two of the five are about a tag’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"body"}]},{"text":", and whether a tag scopes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"something is a fact about the score around it, which no repair could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guess at. The other three are about its ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"parameters"}]},{"text":", and each is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value that was written and then thrown away unread.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Why the parameter issues are judged after normalization","level":2,"anchor":"Why-the-parameter-issues-are-judged-after-normalization","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A defect is only definite once every repair has been tried. ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\volta","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"mark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\volta<m=\"1.\">","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" supplies it under a name since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"renamed — so the tag is missing a required parameter as written and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"complete after ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" renames it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The same holds for a ","type":"text"},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that expands into a closed vocabulary,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and for a span end whose written parameters are dropped before they can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overrun its template. This is why ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Error\/notNormalized","type":"reference"},{"text":" rather than judging an unnormalized score.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Every issue is fatal","level":2,"anchor":"Every-issue-is-fatal","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no grading, and no issue is advisory. Any of the five leaves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returning the score unvalidated, because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a set this small holds nothing worth tolerating: a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\slur","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scoping","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scoping something, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\clef","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with no type are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all defects the writer meant otherwise.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A Guido renderer warns on every one of the five and draws the score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"anyway. That is a divergence, and a deliberate one — a renderer answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“can something be drawn?”, and this is a library answering “is this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"score well formed?”. In each case a value that was written is thrown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"away without being read, and the rendered score says nothing about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loss. What each field ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"means"}]},{"text":" is Guido’s to say; what to do about a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"violation is not.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnvalidator\/issue"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNValidatorV5IssueO","role":"symbol","title":"GMNValidator.Issue","roleHeading":"Enumeration","extendedModule":"IvorGMN","symbolKind":"enum"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"id